{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a mini puzzle game for cooperative puzzle-solving abilities that may test the emotional strength of the relationship between friends/partners, requiring you to trust, accept, and even tolerate each other. With simple controls (three buttons) and a loud voice, you can make the Balloon Friends UP and DOWN, exactly like your emotions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simple operation:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just control the movement of your balloon to the left and right, and absorb the gas from your teammate to make yourself rise!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simple mechanism:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll play in puzzle levels with different mechanisms and functions. Solve them and get to the end! Come and Start your tacit challenge! All that you need is to bring your <i>Booming Voice</i> along with your dear him/her(/it?). But please don't fight with each other, or at least try to be gentle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Not-so-simple teammate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, remember this: Dealing with the puzzles might not get you through the levels; dealing with your teammate might will.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One For You, One For Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3061030/9e0c43af78ac278dd3312c39db264e3c867dcf13.jpg"},{"name":"All Mine!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3061030/e25bee35be30fd3f7a00f2102f13cf0b49b3bccf.jpg"},{"name":"I Can't Anymore!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3061030/3beb46fa0710d1c28bf1abf39d28059d7abf5771.jpg"},{"name":"You Jump, I Jump","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3061030/f6ac7d05769f33d8a30be02d00bbcad562114cc9.jpg"},{"name":"Again Maybe?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3061030/a68c90a76a8125bc1a445a83c732f2eaccc192da.jpg"},{"name":"Litt